        "Wickham", role="aut"))
Description: A fresh take on iterators in R. Designed to be
        cross-compatible with the 'iterators' package, but using the
        'nextOr' method will offer better performance as well as more
        compact code. With batteries included: includes a collection of
        iterator constructors and combinators ported and refined from
        the 'iterators', 'itertools', and 'itertools2' packages.
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
